:\t-\r \r Process Information:\r \tProcess ID:\t\t0x940\r \tProcess Name:\t\tC:\\Windows\\System32\\notepad.exe\r \r Access Request Information:\r \tTransaction ID:\t\t{00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000}\r \tAccesses:\t\tREAD_CONTROL\r \t\t\t\tQuery key value\r \t\t\t\tEnumerate sub-keys\r \t\t\t\tNotify about changes to keys\r \t\t\t\t\r \tAccess Reasons:\t\t-\r \tAccess Mask:\t\t0x20019\r \tPrivileges Used for Access Check:\t-\r \tRestricted SID Count:\t0\r\nevt-00793 | 4658 | 2026-05-06T00:01:51.113Z |  | The handle to an object was closed.\r \r Subject :\r \tSecurity ID:\t\tS-1-5-21-4107722679-1012484280-3777968168-1104\r \tAccount Name:\t\tm.ward\r \tAccount Domain:\t\tCORP\r \tLogon ID:\t\t0x163D26\r \r Object:\r \tObject Server:\t\tSecurity\r \tHandle ID:\t\t0x230\r \r Process Information:\r \tProcess ID:\t\t0x940\r \tProcess Name:\t\tC:\\Windows\\System32\\notepad.exe\r\nevt-00795 | 4658 | 2026-05-06T00:01:51.114Z |  | The handle to an object was closed.\r \r Subject :\r \tSecurity ID:\t\tS-1-5-21-4107722679-1012484280-3777968168-1104\r \tAccount Name:\t\tm.ward\r \tAccount Domain:\t\tCORP\r \tLogon ID:\t\t0x163D26\r \r Object:\r \tObject Server:\t\tSecurity\r \tHandle ID:\t\t0x28fc\r \r Process Information:\r \tProcess ID:\t\t0x940\r \tProcess Name:\t\tC:\\Windows\\System32\\notepad.exe\r\nevt-00796 | 4656 | 2026-05-06T00:01:51.114Z |  | A handle to an object was requested.\r \r Subject:\r \tSecurity ID:\t\tS-1-5-21-4107722679-1012484280-3777968168-1104\r \tAccount Name:\t\tm.ward\r \tAccount Domain:\t\tCORP\r \tLogon ID:\t\t0x163D26\r \r Object:\r \tObject Server:\t\tSecurity\r \tObject Type:\t\tKey\r \tObject Name:\t\t\\REGISTRY\\MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\.NETFramework\r \tHandle ID:\t\t0x270\r \tResource Attributes:\t-\r \r Process Information:\r \tProcess ID:\t\t0x940\r \tProcess Name:\t\tC:\\Windows\\System32\\notepad.exe\r \r Access Request Information:\r \tTransaction ID:\t\t{00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000}\r \tAccesses:\t\tREAD_CONTROL\